[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-RPT-012
STATUS: Active
TITLE: utc_iso and MIN_EPOCH_US
STATEMENT: >>>
`utc_iso(epoch_us)` returns the UTC time of `epoch_us / 1e6` seconds since the epoch formatted
`%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ` (the fraction of a second is dropped). `MIN_EPOCH_US` is 1262304000000000
(2010-01-01T00:00:00Z in microseconds).
<<<
VERIFICATION: Inspection
VERIFICATION_NOTE: >>>
No test in this item's files calls `utc_iso` directly. A review checks the format string, the UTC time zone and
the constant.
<<<
ALLOCATION: report
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: HLR-RPT-028

