[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-RPT-035
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Provider constants
STATEMENT: >>>
The module constants are `DEFAULT_ANTHROPIC_MODEL` `"claude-sonnet-4-6"`, `DEFAULT_GROQ_MODEL`
`"llama-3.3-70b-versatile"`, `GROQ_BASE_URL` `"https://api.groq.com/openai/v1"`, `REQUEST_TIMEOUT_S` 30.0
(seconds) and `MAX_RETRIES` 2.
<<<
