[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-RPT-046
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Time of each path point
STATEMENT: >>>
`_point_times(report)` returns one entry per `gps_path` point. When `log_start_utc` is empty, or
`gps_path_t_s` is empty or of a different length from the path, every entry is None. Otherwise each entry is
`log_start_utc` (parsed with `%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ` as UTC; any other form raises `ValueError`) plus the point's
`gps_path_t_s` seconds. `_iso(t)` formats a time as `%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S.` followed by three millisecond digits
(truncated) and `Z`.
