`fetch_weather(lat, lon, timestamp_utc)` returns the "unavailable" dict (`temperature_max_c`,
`temperature_min_c`, `wind_speed_max_ms`, `rain_sum_mm` all None, `description` "Weather data unavailable")
without any request when `lat` or `lon` is None, when both are 0, or when `_flight_date` returns None. A
