[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-RPT-055
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Weather result
STATEMENT: >>>
From the first value of each daily list `fetch_weather` returns `temperature_max_c` and `temperature_min_c`
as received (deg C), `wind_speed_max_ms` = the received wind (km/h) divided by 3.6 and rounded to 2 decimal
places (None when absent), `rain_sum_mm` as received, and `description` = the parts that apply joined by ", ":
"Temp: `<min>` deg C to `<max>` deg C" (written with the degree sign) when both exist, "Wind: `<m/s>` m/s max"
when wind exists, "Rain: `<mm>` mm" when rain is above 0, "Dry" when rain is 0, and nothing for rain when it is
None.
<<<
