[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-RPT-064
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Report template content
STATEMENT: >>>
`report.html`, as rendered by `render_report_html`, shows in order: a header (report id, rendering time, file
name, size in KB to 1 decimal; when `letter_grade` is "-" a grey dash, the label and "No module could assess
this log", otherwise the overall score rounded to an integer, the label and "Grade <letter>" in the score
colour; and when `assessed_fraction` is set, "Assessed: <n>% of the scoring weight"); "Flight Information"
(duration `MM:SS`, arm events, flight modes, and when truthy max altitude in m, max speed in m/s, firmware,
hardware; processing time in s; schema version); "Executive Summary"; "Findings" with the count and, when the
list is empty, a grey line saying no module could assess the log and that this is not a clean result (letter
grade "-"), a green line naming the assessed share when `assessed_fraction` is below 1, or the green line "No
significant issues detected in this flight log." otherwise; "Parse Warnings" listing `metadata.parse_warnings`
when there are any; per finding the severity, title, category, confidence as a percentage, start time (only
when `timestamp_start_ms` is truthy), plain-English text, action, technical summary and a table of its
parameter changes; "Parameter Change Sheet" when not empty; "Module Summary" with, per result, the display
name, "Skipped" when skipped, "Not assessed" when not assessed, else "Ran", the score out of 100 only when
assessed, the finding count, `processing_ms` and the skip reason; an "Internal Review Record" block; and the
closing statement. It does not show the confidence level, weather, place name or SHA-256.
<<<
